# Dependencies

## Tooling

- Package manager: Bun only (`packageManager` in `package.json`)
- Do not add npm/yarn/pnpm lockfiles

## Keep it lean

Add a dependency only when the hackathon feature needs it.

Prefer stacks already in netmifi-mono when you do add one:

- Validation: `zod`
- Dates: `date-fns`
- Auth (if needed): `better-auth`
- DB (if needed): `drizzle-orm`

## Avoid unless explicitly required

- `@tanstack/react-router` / `@tanstack/react-query` — this app uses App Router
- `hono` / `@trpc/*` — mono’s API layer; do not duplicate here for the demo
- `any`-typed or unmaintained UI kits that cannot move to `@netmifi/design`

## Versions

- React stays on 19.x to match both this app and mono
- Use `bun add` / `bun add -d`; do not hand-edit lockfile
